== 7. What the floor minimum's drop follows. Per arm, k consecutive LATE windows are pooled (span k x 250 ms). The doubling drop d = F(k) - F(2k) is regressed on ln of each candidate abscissa at the step (samples n, span k, acks a = the arm's srv0 packet rate x span), pooled over a cell's arms below 0.8 u. The arm's load cancels in d. The smallest residual sd is the better descriptor ==
